{"unit_id":"exoticknight__dsh-theme-eink-retro#feature-1","repo":"exoticknight/dsh-theme-eink-retro","commit":"4b6d03f06b9f44273d194e2b9f92579e63cf6503","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"E-Ink Retro 的功能「平衡与沉浸配色」：把 DSH 语义主题令牌映射为纸白、墨黑和灰阶；平衡模式保留成功、警告和错误的语义色，沉浸模式将这些状态色也转为墨色阶梯。在设置页选择模式后立即应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/tokens.ts:27-48","src/client/tokens.ts:128-155","src/client/index.ts:216-242"]}
